            "sid": "ISA 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khunyanga eyo amataala kabwe ketsingoba kalaba shinga amakunda kabaHiwi nabaAmori aka baleshela abaIsiraeli; nabwo bulaba obwonooneshi bwonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.17.9",
